  "concept": {"zh": "差分读数与区间调节", "en": "Delta readings and overlapping adjustments"},
  "brief": {"zh": "ACC 是进站温度，地址 0 到 4 是随后五站各自相对前一站的温度变化。地址 5 的工单只调节第 1 至 3 站，地址 6 的工单只调节第 2 至 4 站（站号从 0 开始，均含两端）。重叠处两次都算。将每站的最终温度写回对应地址，保留两份工单。ACC 留下第 4 站比第 0 站高多少度，可以为负。", "en": "ACC is the entry temperature. Addresses 0 through 4 are changes from the preceding stop. The signed adjustment at 5 applies only to stops 1 through 3 inclusive. The one at 6 applies only to stops 2 through 4 inclusive. Stops start at 0, and both orders apply where they overlap. Replace each change with that stop’s final temperature, preserve both orders, and leave stop 4 minus stop 0 in ACC."},
